{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tdDIfuyGSa1794837854.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中美交流基金會舉辦第七屆香港中美論壇。中國駐美大使謝鋒視像致辭，稱期望香港繼續發揮獨特優勢，打造中美合作共贏的新高地。</p><p></p><p>中國駐美國大使謝鋒表示：「香港是中外文化薈萃之地，是中美人文交流的重要樞紐。我希望香港充分發揮作為超級聯繫人和超級增值人的獨特優勢，在中美合作的廣闊天地中深耕厚植、開拓進取，打造中美合作共贏的新高地。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:19:40.608468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:25.272420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:13:04.441291+00:00","content_hash":"f479db82d11f92cce6f0c194b102e6aab9927992361dafca1ed15815ddfca616","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T15:19:40.608468+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}